# Product Card Homework Project

This is a React application that displays a list of products using reusable components.

## Features
- Display product cards with image, title, price, category, rating, and brand
- Stock status indicator (Sold Out, Low Stock, In Stock)
- Search functionality to filter products
- Click on a product to view detailed information
- Responsive grid layout

## Technologies Used
- React
- JavaScript
- CSS

## Structure
- App.js: Root component
- Home.jsx: Handles product display and search
- ProductCard.jsx: Reusable product card component
- styles.css: Styling for layout and design
